msgid "Voice API"
msgstr "音声API"

#: ../../../source/voice.rst:5
msgid ""
"The Voice API allows you to interact with a phone via beautiful HTTP "
"endpoints."
msgstr "通話用APIを利用すると、簡潔なHTTPエンドポイントに電話でつなげることができます。"

#: ../../../source/voice.rst:8
msgid ""
"There is a minimum amount of credits which you need to have in order to "
"make a Voice API call, regardless of the cost of the call itself. Please "
"refer to the `Help Center <https://help.xoxzo.com/en/xoxzo-cloud-"
"telephony-platform/articles/minimum-credits-for-voice-api/>`_ for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"音声APIを利用するための料金にかかわらず、アカウントにあるクレジットが最低残高でないといけない場合があります。詳細については `ヘルプ・センター"
" <https://help.xoxzo.com/ja/xoxzo-cloud-telephony-platform/articles"
"/minimum-credits-for-voice-api/>`_ をご確認ください。"

#: ../../../source/voice.rst:12
msgid ""
"You can see how this API works on the web at `hello.xoxzo.com "
"<https://hello.xoxzo.com/en/>`_"
msgstr "このAPIがウェブではどう動くのか、`hello.xoxzo.com <https://hello.xoxzo.com/ja/>`_ で見てみよう"

